description=Shared foundation of the Dazed mod suite. Does nothing on its own. Provides what Dazed Power, Dazed Plumbing and the rest need: heavy machines carried as parts like a bed or shelving, the Building Picker (map houses, basements and player-built structures, on a dedicated server too), the power registry the mods talk to each other through, synced tables, notes, sandbox presets, the in-game guide and a shared options page. Required by Dazed Plumbing 0.10 and later and by Dazed Power.
